# Build context for backend/Dockerfile is the REPOSITORY ROOT (the image needs
# contracts/deployments/84532.json alongside the Rust sources). Without this file the context
# includes contracts/lib/swap-vm/node_modules and every build artefact — hundreds of megabytes
# uploaded on every `docker build` and every `fly deploy`.
#
# Keep in sync with backend/Dockerfile's COPY lines: backend/{Cargo.toml,Cargo.lock,build.rs,abi,src}
# and contracts/deployments/84532.json.

*
!backend/Cargo.toml
!backend/Cargo.lock
!backend/build.rs
!backend/abi/
!backend/src/
!contracts/deployments/84532.json

# Belt and braces: even under the allow-list above, never let these in.
**/node_modules/
**/target/
**/.git/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.production.example
!**/.env.sepolia.example
